	"Description": "i was bored of the usual &#39;worm&#39; dig spot, so i replaced it. they&#39;re also easier to see. i hope you like &#33; all of the new digspots are animated (i.e bouncing, colour changing or in the junimos case - dancing)\r<br />\r<br />this is my first attempt at any sort of game file editing, so if anything isn&#39;t working or doesn&#39;t look right i apologise &#33; i&#39;m planning on releasing more XNB mods so if anyone has any requests i&#39;d be happy to hear them.\r<br />\r<br />to download, place the &#39;cursors.xnb&#39; file into Stardew Valley &gt; Content &gt; Loose Sprites. [b]i advise you to backup the original cursors.xnb file[/b] if you wish to go back to the worms.\r<br />\r<br />if you need any help, hmu (-:\r<br />[left][/left]\r<br />\r<br />this mod is [u]not[/u] compatible\u00A0with any other xnb mod that changes the cursors.xnb files.\r<br />[center][/center]",
